# Build-context hygiene. **/bin and **/obj are critical: local (Windows) builds
# leave obj/project.assets.json referencing the Visual Studio NuGet fallback
# folder, which breaks the Linux publish step if it leaks into the context.
**/bin
**/obj
*.user
*.suo
.vs
TestResults
coverage
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.log
